om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706420/extras/3bbafd94a06f4710bb94738a607c466c.avif?t=1746458736\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rebuild Civilization Underground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through each lair, using the cleared rooms and resources to build workshops, armories, apothecaries, mushroom farms, dormitories, and all the other facilities needed to comfortably support 250 people at each Warmhaven location. Optimize the base layout and attract the professions that will lead to good health, morale, and renown for each community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive an Art Nouveau Edwardian ice age</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renovate dungeons and move in, not just loot them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gleefully demolish monsters, traps, and ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play elements (fire, ice, pollution, darkness) against each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic base design and community management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constant character and base progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun solarpunk take on arpg and survival basebuilding genres</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Dungeon Renovators is a base-builder and action RPG with online co-op. You are a Renovator: combat-ready craftsmen who reclaim dungeons for humanity, demolish evil structures for materials, then build bases to train, craft equipment, attract workers, level up and rebuild civilization!",
